RR-3 & A & 3 & Fixed RR & Keyword/max \\
RR-4 & A & 4 & Fixed RR & Keyword/max \\
Sel-3 & B1 & 3+1 & LLM-routed & Keyword/max \\
Sel-4 & B1 & 4+1 & LLM-routed & Keyword/max \\
